  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM - Humanitarian Response in Cabo Delgado, Mozambique (Phase III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to empower resilient individuals and communities in northern Mozambique. IOM will address acute needs of displaced and vulnerable migrants in Cabo Delgado, propose a comprehensive and integrated intervention, with the main purpose to ensure dignified, safe and secure living conditions and basic services for vulnerable populations affected by disasters driven by natural hazards and conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
